[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5188019262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122110#issuecomment-5188019262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122110","id":5188019262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNTrkPg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-05T05:42:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T05:42:09Z","body":"> Maybe we should make platform/web/serve.py able to host with HTTPS and a self-signed certificate?\r\n\r\nI'm using `serve.py` script with the following change:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/platform/web/serve.py b/platform/web/serve.py\r\nindex 4e1521449b..a487e4b89a 100755\r\n--- a/platform/web/serve.py\r\n+++ b/platform/web/serve.py\r\n@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ import contextlib\r\n import os\r\n import socket\r\n import subprocess\r\n+import ssl\r\n import sys\r\n from http.server import HTTPServer, SimpleHTTPRequestHandler\r\n from pathlib import Path\r\n@@ -40,8 +41,12 @@ def serve(root, port, run_browser):\r\n\r\n     address = (\"\", port)\r\n     httpd = DualStackServer(address, CORSRequestHandler)\r\n+    context = ssl.SSLContext(ssl.PROTOCOL_TLS_SERVER)\r\n+    context.load_cert_chain(certfile=\"cert.pem\", keyfile=\"key.pem\")\r\n\r\n-    url = f\"http://127.0.0.1:{port}\"\r\n+    httpd.socket = context.wrap_socket(httpd.socket, server_side=True)\r\n+\r\n+    url = f\"https://127.0.0.1:{port}\"\r\n     if run_browser:\r\n         # Open the served page in the user's default browser.\r\n         print(f\"Opening the served URL in the default browser (use `--no-browser` or `-n` to disable this): {url}\")\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5188019262/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5256120990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122110#issuecomment-5256120990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122110","id":5256120990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOUoKng","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_